  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hepatitis Prevention and Control Project in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conduct a situation assessment and analysis on national viral hepatits programs in Africa. Conduct an investigation on the prevalence of Heptitis B and Hepatitis C in 5 countries in Africa. Develop the five year Africa continetal Action Plan for Elimination of Heptitis and technical guideline for hepatitis screening, care, treatment and prevention. Establish the viral heptitis sentinel surveillance system for acute hepatitis, chronic hepatitis, risk factors and burden of sequelae.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the disease burden of hepatitis and move from control to elimination of hepatitis in 5 countries in Africa by the end of 2023&#x25a3; &#xc5f0;&#xd569; 55&#xac1c;&#xad6d; &#xac04;&#xc5fc; &#xd604;&#xd669; &#xbc0f; &#xc2a4;&#xd06c;&#xb9ac;&#xb2dd;, &#xce58;&#xb8cc;, &#xc608;&#xbc29;&#xc744; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xad6d;&#xac00; &#xc2e4;&#xd589;&#xacc4;&#xd68d;/&#xac00;&#xc774;&#xb4dc;&#xb77c;&#xc778; &#xc218;&#xb9bd; &#xb610;&#xb294; &#xbe44;&#xc900;
&#x25a3; &#xc5f0;&#xd569; 55&#xac1c;&#xad6d; &#xac04;&#xc5fc; &#xbcf4;&#xac74;&#xc778;&#xb825; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xac15;&#xd654;
&#x25a3; &#xc2dc;&#xbc94; 5&#xac1c;&#xad6d; B&#xd615;, C&#xd615; &#xac04;&#xc5fc; &#xc720;&#xbcd1;&#xb960; &#xc870;&#xc0ac; &#xc2dc;&#xbc94;&#xc0ac;&#xc5c5; &#xc2e4;&#xc2dc;
&#x25a3; &#xc544;&#xd504;&#xb9ac;&#xce74; 10&#xac1c; &#xac04;&#xc5fc; &#xac10;&#xc2dc;&#xc13c;&#xd130; &#xad6c;&#xcd95; &#xbc0f; &#xc6b4;&#xc601;</narrative>
